{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112073","id":2949435905,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6vzNIB","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112073","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112073.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112073.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112073","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112073/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112073/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112073/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/c1ee8e52e448f4052ff8e73fe132de4b601f2512","number":112073,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Improve CSV translations","user":{"login":"timothyqiu","id":372476,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjQ3Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/372476?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu","html_url":"https://github.com/timothyqiu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/1291\r\nCloses #38862\r\nFixes #101464\r\nFixes #47883 \r\nSupersedes #41519\r\nSupersedes #101471\r\nSupersedes #108050\r\n\r\n## Context and plural support\r\n\r\n- Use `?context` column to specify the context.\r\n  | en | ?context | fr | ru | zh |\r\n  | ---|----------|----|----|--- |\r\n  | Letter | Alphabet | Lettre | Буква | 字母 |\r\n  | Letter | Message  | Courrier | Письмо | 信件 |\r\n  ```csv\r\n  en,?context,fr,ru,ja,zh\r\n  Letter,Alphabet,Lettre,Буква,字母,字母\r\n  Letter,Message,Courrier,Письмо,手紙,信件\r\n  ```\r\n- Use `?plural` column to enable the plural rows. Use `?pluralrule` row to customize the plural rule.\r\n  | en | ?plural | fr | ru | zh |\r\n  | --- | ------- | --- | --- | --- |\r\n  | ?pluralrule |  | nplurals=2; plural=(n >= 2); |  |  |\r\n  | There is %d apple | There are %d apples | Il y a %d pomme | Есть %d яблоко | 那里有%d个苹果\r\n  | |  | Il y a %d pommes | Есть %d яблока |  |\r\n  | |  |  | Есть %d яблок |  |\r\n\r\n  ```csv\r\n  en,?plural,fr,ru,ja,zh\r\n  ?pluralrule,,nplurals=2; plural=(n >= 2);,,\r\n  There is %d apple,There are %d apples,Il y a %d pomme,Есть %d яблоко,リンゴが%d個あります,那里有%d个苹果\r\n  ,,Il y a %d pommes,Есть %d яблока,,\r\n  ,,,Есть %d яблок,,\r\n  ```\r\n\r\nThe plural idea is salvaged from #101471:\r\n\r\n- Uses `?` prefix instead of `_` so it's more compatible.\r\n    - Old versions ignore columns that starts with an underscore.\r\n    - `?` is considered part of the metadata, while `_` columns can be freely added by anyone.\r\n- Plural rows are only allowed when `?plural` is specified.\r\n  - Whether plural forms are supported is not specified by the translator, `tr_n(msgid, msgid_plural, n)` must be used in the code.\r\n  - Although the source plural message itself is not used (neither is the PO loader), this makes it possible to auto generate such files, interchangably.\r\n\r\nThe `OptimizedTranslation` class is kept as-is. No context or plural support is added. But I added some comments and documentation.\r\n\r\nThe CSV importer now creates a regular `Translation` instead of `OptimizedTranslation` when context or plural is used in the CSV file. The `compress` import option is changed from a boolean to an enum of Disabled or Auto.\r\n\r\nTest project: [csv-context-plurals.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23161482/csv-context-plurals.zip)\r\n\r\n## Unescape import options\r\n\r\nTwo options are added to the CSV translation importer:\r\n\r\n- `unescape_keys`: Whether to process escape sequences in the key column's text\r\n- `unescape_translations`: Whether to process escape sequences in the translated text\r\n\r\nThey have different defaults to match the current behavior.\r\n\r\nTest project: [csv-unescape.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/17475390/csv-unescape.zip)","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8133949121,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAAB5NI2wQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:i18n","name":"topic:i18n","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/u